Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:37:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Project prefill Q, K and V in one dispatch

The three projections read the same normalized rows. One launch with two
eight-column tiles per block replaces three; every warp runs the unchanged
K16 recurrence with K192 rounding for its tile. Native test: 69 row counts
and seeds bit-identical to the three separate launches, guards included.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
